  "body": "The inert Panda return-buffer bridge now has two executable CPU suppliers: an owner/lifetime-checked provider camera registry and a bounded original-command context/pack/PBO/FBO state cache. The registry retains exact sensor/Texture/buffer/commonGSG owners, keeps64bit handles private, fixes Road1/Wide2 independently of requester, and limits registration+12guards to26named getGsg calls. The Ccallback feeds the existing assembly/core/strictcodec; wrappers forward originals once unchanged with incoming+returnederrno preserved. OFF cache failure also invalidates external finalization despite a corefooter0.\n\nThis is command-derived metadata, not queried or verified driver state. Void original calls do not establish successful driver changes or fresh GPU writes. Fresh-context notifications, complete mutation/error/return coverage, actual native identities/lifetimes, mapped dispatch/build/environment and process/window/sink receipt transport remain unqualified live gates. No loader, GL export, new query/readback, renderer/model run or native activation is added.\n\nValidation:\n\n- 26focused tests PASS0.598s; whole1396tests PASS7skip92.299s.\n- 41actual compiled CPU scenarios pass normal/ASan/UBSan with identical streams/stats. Private fake64bit registry handles traverse cache\u2192unchangedassembly/core\u2192codec/receipt.\n- One fresh whole-branch review independently rebuilt all41pre-fix scenarios and verified47proofs582205B. Critical0,Important2,Minor0. One RED\u2192GREEN fix pass rejects swallowed GSGdescriptor reentry and getter-induced owner changes without extra getGsg calls. No rereview.\n- 98indexed proofs1,676,508B include reviewed pre-fix copies and active receipts. Build1.742395934s wall excludes tests/review/CI/development and measures no renderer overhead.\n- All2624base files/299oldsourcepins/10original trace+graph+ZIP artifacts preserved. Main, oldDraft102\u2013106/eightnativehistories unchanged; no sharedbase/main push/merge/Cloudregistry publication or oldrequest reuse. New native/GL/provider/officialmodel/officialORT0; consumednativeallowance0remaining.\n\nOriginal strict0/4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE remain. DefaultFBO/shared contexts/differentGSGs/missing explicit readselector are deliberately rejected, not guessed.\n\nRulings I made (exhaustive, with costs):\n\n1. Continue inline/samecheckout/noquestions per persistent user preference \u2014 next missing suppliers are owner registry and cached state \u2014 CPU/development cost, no native allowance spent.\n2. Use original-call command cache instead of GLqueries or manually assumed state \u2014 preserve original GL call counts and detect missing state \u2014 command success/coverage remains unqualified until native delivery/error receipts are checked.\n3. Require onecommonGSG/twodistinctTexture+buffer owners and view0/z=-1 bridge \u2014 current bridge supports one GSG, roles must not derive from requester \u2014 actual differentGSG setups reject until a new qualified contract.\n4. Require nonzero readFBO and explicitly observed color selector \u2014 default buffer capability/selector cannot be guessed from context creation \u2014 default-FBO capture remains unsupported.\n5. Retain valid emittedprefix when later eventbudget fails \u2014 observation1 was valid before cap5 exhausted \u2014 failedcompletion/receipt prevents acceptance, and erasingprefix would discard actual evidence.\n6. rc_finalize folds actualproducer finish and cacheerror (including OFF) \u2014 corefooter may report0 while cache failed \u2014 external sink/process receipt must still be qualified and combine its own failures.\n7. Actualdriverstate/GPUwrites remain unproven \u2014 voidCPUshaped originals cannot establish successfuldriverchanges \u2014 nativeerror/state evidence remains futurecost.\n8. Contextnotification authenticity stays unqualified \u2014 creation/current/destroy are caller-delivered inputs \u2014 livebootstrap/return binding must be checked before native acceptance.\n9. Undeliveredmutations remain coveragegate \u2014 cache cannot see calls it never receives \u2014 futurelayer must cover or invalidate clientattribute and othermutators.\n10. RealPanda/nativeidentity/allocation/lifetime/sameaddressreuse compatibility stays unqualified \u2014 onlyprovider-shaped fakes were used \u2014 actualprovider/lifetime receipts remain necessary.\n11. DefaultFBO/sharedcontext/differentGSG support stays rejected \u2014 currentexplicitcontract excludes guessing those states \u2014 futureusers need separatelyqualified support.\n12. ValidCstorage/deleteinputspan/nonnullnormaloriginals/noconcurrentstorage destruction remain callerpreconditions \u2014 bounded noquery Ccannot authenticate arbitrarymemory \u2014 violations canfault outside acceptedintegration.\n13. Process/window/sinkreceipt authenticity remains unqualified \u2014 syntheticdicts establishconsistency only \u2014 realtransport andsinkclosure must still be qualified.\n14. Runtime loader/maps/activation/nativecanary/model/officialORT stay inactive \u2014 currentcomponents grant no runtime admission \u2014 newcontract/freshcanary stillrequired.\n15. Nativeperformance remains unmeasured \u2014 CPUbuild/testwall excludes rendererwork \u2014 actualoverhead/control measurements are futurecost.\n16. Priorcore/assembly/codec remain immutable revieweddependencies \u2014 authorfullsuite covers integration; reviewer focused on newsource/all41CPUcases \u2014 no new fullbaseline independentreview was purchased.\n17. ExactsourceCI/Draft/finalpreservation closeout follows review \u2014 reviewed snapshot reported these as pending \u2014 externalimmutableHEAD receipts will verify finalstate without claiming prematurecompletion.\n\nDeferred minors: none.\n\nResult: docs/STAGE7_READBACK_STATE_SUPPLIERS_RESULT.md\nLedger: docs/STAGE7_READBACK_STATE_SUPPLIERS_LEDGER.md\nProofs: docs/evidence/readback-state-suppliers-01/proof-index.json\nReview: docs/evidence/READBACK_STATE_SUPPLIERS_01_REVIEW.md\nNext execution: docs/STAGE7_READBACK_STATE_SUPPLIERS_CONTINUATION.md\n\nStacks on feature/panda-readback-abi-v1 at868f65e368bcb811bce64f61c988a27bbed612f2. Exact source CI closeout is recorded below without changing the source commit.\n\nSource HEAD: c06a3a3eb8e215a8e40054433cf4c6c4c1d42bdc\n\nExact source closeout (2026-11-15T07:39:12.018912+09:00):\n\nSourcec06a3a3eb8e215a8e40054433cf4c6c4c1d42bdc; Draft107 remains unmerged; base868f65e368bcb811bce64f61c988a27bbed612f2; body roundtrip verified.\n\n- pull_request: https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43649025184 \u2014 success,attempt1,2jobs,0artifacts; jobIDs 132613110992,132613111208.\n- push: https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43648849130 \u2014 success,attempt1,2jobs,0artifacts; jobIDs 132612577243,132612577528.\n\nFinal recheck: all2624baseGitblobs/299oldpins/10original artifacts match;98indexed proofs1,676,508B are inGit;110added paths and0base/workflow edits. Main48e79a7ed5aedf6daa5a62ff68d2225af7955ef1/oldDraft102\u2013106/eightnativehistories unchanged. No new native/GL/provider/officialmodel/officialORT, oldrequest reuse, mainmerge or Cloudregistry publication. Commandstate remains distinct from driverstate/liveevent/identity/runtime/GPU authority. Final verification: output/stage7-readback-state-suppliers-01/final-verification.json. Next steps: docs/STAGE7_READBACK_STATE_SUPPLIERS_CONTINUATION.md.\n",
